{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar","id":1530940,"title":"Am Kindred, a Werewolf and a Mage on the bar.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-15T19:02:14-08:00","id":1530940,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon7.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Am Kindred, a Werewolf and a Mage on the bar.","content":"Think of it as an exercise or a game if you prefer, basically you take two creatures of darkness and someone else thinks about how they would interact and at the end they write another pair and so on. It seems random, but I think some interesting thoughts can come out of it. Starting.<br /> <br /> Unfleashed Promethean (The Manufactured) and Invasive (Cyborg) Deviant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-16T05:22:21-08:00","id":1530971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar#post1530940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfleashed Promethean (The Manufactured) and Invasive (Cyborg) Deviant.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Unfleashed Promethean walk into a bar, deciding to partake in the Human activity of drinking small dose of poison.<br /> <br /> Sitting next to him is a Man, who hide most of his body in a hoodie, I try to talk with him, but he just ignore me. Most of the time I would just leave to find a better conversation parther, but something about the man remind me of myself. So, I continue to talk to him, even if doesn't respond to my conversation, when suddenly he slam his fist down and break the bar counter, in that moment, I could hear the sound of gear and steam pumping.<br /> <br /> I think the Unfleashed Promethean would at first feel an air of familiarity from the Invasive Deviant, but after getting to know the Invasive Devaint, the Unfleashed Promethean would probably be weirded out by the Deviant, for how they manage to have both Flesh and Machine in the same body, but working so against eachother, but after that the Unfleashed Promethean would be curious of the Deviant power that is so similiar to their own, and scar that is quite similiar to their torment.<br /> <br /> The Invasive Deviant, would first think that the Promethean is somekind of Deviant themselve, but after getting to know the Promethean, the Invasive Deviant would both feel pity for the Promethean that it's hated by everyone, but also jealous that it's can become fully human again, and then prospect in having the Promethean spread Wasteland in the Conspiracy territory.<br /> <br /> Psychic Vampire (Supernatural Merit Template) and Daeva Kindred (Vampire).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-16T14:34:45-08:00","id":1531004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1530971#post1530971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Psychic Vampire (Supernatural Merit Template) and Daeva Kindred (Vampire).</div> </div> </div> </div>A psychic enters the bar like he does once or twice a week casually to eat and maybe something else, he had a strict system for eating in bars, even if it was normal for someone to pass out drunk they might find it strange that this always happened when he was there, so the rules were for him to never go to the same place more than twice a week and never on consecutive days, if possible not to eat two nights in a row and to frequent the place even if he didn't eat.<br /> <br /> He orders a cheap drink and looks for a table, hoping someone is alone, it was always easier when they were alone. Finally he finds someone, little did he know it was a kindred. From then on, the two talk and the psychic tries to feed on the kindred discreetly, but without success he becomes confused. The kindred, realizing what is happening, invites him to visit him at his home tomorrow night. The psychic agrees and leaves. One thinking about whether it will really go and how to prepare for it, the other thinking about whether it will serve as an instrument or whether it will just be a toy.<br /> <br /> I know, this one one wasn't so good.<br /> <br /> Galatea Promethean and Daeva Vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T04:02:04-08:00","id":1531054,"title":"","content":"The Daeva spies the Galatea from across the room and is immediately entranced, she spliys the rest of the evening between wooing and fighting of jealous rivals.<br /> <br /> <br /> Elemental (Clockwork automoton) Plaything of the Autumn Court, who think they are an Angel and a Integrator Messenger Demon...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27248,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","user":"orathaic","date":". 02-18-2024, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T19:39:30-08:00","id":1531219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531054#post1531054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Daeva spies the Galatea from across the room and is immediately entranced, she spliys the rest of the evening between wooing and fighting of jealous rivals.<br /> <br /> <br /> Elemental (Clockwork automoton) Plaything of the Autumn Court, who think they are an Angel and a Integrator Messenger Demon...</div> </div> </div> </div>The two by chance end up going to the same bar, the messenger notices the Lost first, he is suspicious of anyone who has something strange, he notices the supernatural nature of his companion who is talking to someone else, normally he wouldn't care, but this case was a exception, with *Eavesdrop* he tries to evaluate what the two are talking about, most of it is useless nonsense, but he can barely hide his surprise when he realizes that the Lost mentions an angel, unfortunately his mentions are very vague and the messenger cannot draw a definitive conclusion with just this little bit of information. He watches a little more and waits for the guy leave the bar to follow him at a safe distance. It was night and already dark, ideal for what he intended to do. In front of a closed traffic signal, the messenger takes out of his pocket army knife that he kept with him and points it at the Elemental's back, with a threatening whisper he order him to follow until a vacant lot at the end of the street, the The messenger expected him to show a minimal reaction, but the guy laughs lightly and just nods in agreement, very strange, this situation was very peculiar for the demon's taste, but it was not time to hesitate, after all he still had the advantage.<br /> <br /> Inside the vacant lot the messenger asks some simple questions to the changeling who doesn't seem to understand most of it, not even referring to the angel by a name or designation, just calling him &quot;the angel&quot;. Disappointed, the messenger thinks about his next step, he is unlikely to get any valuable information from this guy and if it weren't for the obvious supernatural trait that comes from him he could easily pass for an ordinary human being, but perhaps he would still be useful, he doesn't appear to be a mere cultist and is too functional to be a simple God-Machine experiment. While rambling, the elemental lightly holds the messenger's hand who was holding the knife, he shouts a warning, but it is ignored and with a slow and agonizing movement the blade is dragged across the changeling's skin, however the sensation is not that of a cut in the flesh, or warm of blood, but metal scratching metal, this accompanied by a horrible sharp creak, then the messenger has his wrist pulled by the elemental and his body is knocked against the earth, the demon soon recovers only to witness the elemental laughing at his conquest, not a happy laugh, but a forced and almost mechanical one.<br /> <br /> A thin layer of golden dust comes out of the changeling's body, then this trickle turns into a dense smoke that covers his body, showing his true appearance to the world, a large and impossibly wide body for a human, his arms and legs, were sets of pipes and pistons moved by huge gears in place of joints and covered by a layer of metal that appeared to be iron or copper, his body a crude imitation of armor that underneath hid more gears, his face was a bad joke, sets of small gears and metal plates that tried to emulate features, but were not capable of expressing any emotion, giving this work to the voice that was, more of a metallic creak with a touch of a childish voice. The messenger already realized his mistake, the mysterious golden dust already revealed everything, but even if that were the case he didn't need any evidence to know that that thing had nothing to do with angels or the God-Machine, that shape was ugly, exaggerated and grossly efficient, even if the angels were capable of a joke they would never do something so imperfect. For a brief moment the messenger is distracted and lets part of his true form escape, his eyes for a second abandon the human form giving way to two blackened visors, his skin shows several inscriptions that resemble a computer circuit instead of his veins, everything quickly returns to normal, but it is enough for the elemental to admire and try to capture the messenger for his angel, with no expectation of stopping that thing in direct combat he makes brief use of *Imagine* the Lost acts with confusion, his brain unable to process the information he has just received, taking advantage of the distraction time he takes the opportunity to escape, the elemental, still confused, tries to follow him at a smaller pace, but is stopped by a car that moves towards him, hitting him in full, it wasn't fatal, but it leaves him unconscious long enough for the messenger to escape and plan what to do next, little does he know that he just changed a life forever, but that's another story.<br /> <br /> A Osiris Promethean and a Su-Menent (Mummy Necromancer)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27832,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","user":"Psicose","date":". 02-21-2024, 06:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-25T04:43:08-08:00","id":1531463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531219#post1531219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Osiris Promethean and a Su-Menent (Mummy Necromancer)</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, somebody more knowledgable than me, please answer this!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-25T09:15:55-08:00","id":1531472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531463#post1531463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, somebody more knowledgable than me, please answer this!</div> </div> </div> </div>It was too hard?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-26T22:04:27-08:00","id":1531587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531472#post1531472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It was too hard?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know anything about the Su-menemt, and forget whatever I knew about the Osirians (except I thought they would be great for a mummy cross-over).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-27T13:25:50-08:00","id":1531643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531587#post1531587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know anything about the Su-menemt, and forget whatever I knew about the Osirians (except I thought they would be great for a mummy cross-over).</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want, you can use just basic information or respond to a previous pair. Everything to keep the game going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-27T14:30:55-08:00","id":1531651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531219#post1531219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Osiris Promethean and a Su-Menent (Mummy Necromancer)</div> </div> </div> </div>The woman with the missing ear registers a tap on her shoulder and turns her head. An older woman faces her, wearing glasses that might have been fashionable at one point, gaze fixed firmly on her arm where the claws of her latest failure had rent her humour from her flesh.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you have a cat?&quot; asks the bespectacled woman. The question is blunt. Ten seconds pass. The bar is very loud.<br /> <br /> &quot;I do not,&quot; says the woman at the bar, turning back to her drink. She cannot be intoxicated, but she is still in no state to answer questions, much less lie; she came to this place to be around people, not to talk.<br /> <br /> &quot;You should have that scratch looked at, then,&quot; says the woman in cat eye glasses. She smiles with her mouth. &quot;I have a first aid kit in my car. Would you mind coming out with me? I couldn't leave you alone like this, knowing something might happen.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman who is not alive looks around. People are starting to stare. She pulls her broken smartphone from her pocket to cover her missing ear and stands up to leave.<br /> <br /> The woman who is not dead sets a few bills by the abandoned bottle and follows her out. She will ask her questions about the empty graves where her cultists cannot hear.<br /> <br /> Cahalith (Werewolf) and Gristlegrinder Beast (Changeling)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-28T18:05:33-08:00","id":1531713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531651#post1531651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cahalith (Werewolf) and Gristlegrinder Beast (Changeling)</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically I can think of Cahalith going into a bar that was already old during prohibition just to have a cheap beer to forget his problems, and that would be the only reason he would drink because the stuff was more inedible than pork wash. Then he glances at a group together at the back of the bar, at first glance they seem like just another bunch of bullies, but looking closer he notices some half-bitten beer bottles, he knows from the stories that this group was a gang. of the faeric people, or related and better than a cheap drink to forget your problems is a good fight. Then he manages to take the group to the back where they begin to exchange blows, Uratha was stronger than them individually, but they had an advantage of 4 to 1. He had to retreat with his pride hurt and bite marks all over his body.<br /> <br /> Okay, this one was pretty bad, but I really had a block with this one that I can't explain.<br /> <br /> A mummy Afiliated with Am-khabit Judge (Judge of Murder) and Anakim (Giant) Predator Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-28T19:38:23-08:00","id":1531720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531713#post1531713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A mummy Afiliated with Am-khabit Judge (Judge of Murder) and Anakim (Giant) Predator Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>The ancient alchemist can see the telltale strains of mortality held at bay in the shadows of the tavern staff, but the man behind the counter is undeniably living at the normal rate. Whoever is running this business as a front has chosen a formidable face for its day shift. The two exchange nods of passing courtesy, and the pretense of arrangements for a business discussion with the ownership commence.<br /> <br /> At some point the older man compliments the younger on his lion's-head brooch, and the younger man shares a story he is enamored with, a bloody tale of a killing machine \u2014 &quot;the wine-press of the gods,&quot; he says. The phrase snags on something in the depths of the alchemist's memory, and the two discuss popular mythology for a few minutes before returning to matters of property and prices and distillation.<br /> <br /> At some point the older man tips his hand a bit more than necessary, baiting the barman with the implication that he knows more than he is letting on, and the younger man frowns thoughtfully \u2014 and the Jackal-Headed servant of the Eater of Shadows hides his surprise when the broad-chested youth behind the counter is replaced, for a fraction of a second, with the red-rimmed visage of a heavy-handed hunter. The human face returns with a melancholy expression as the younger man comments that this job means a lot to him, given to him as it was as a favor from his aunt.<br /> <br /> At some point the younger man looks at his watch and notes that it's getting dark out. &quot;I'll tell Auntie I. about your offer. Come back tomorrow. Bring your people. We'll talk it out.&quot;<br /> <br /> The alchemist agrees. The thing slumbering in the cellar among casks of stolen Sekhem and its crimson-toothed kin will need strength of numbers to be dealt with, and a night's reprieve from confrontation to strategize is more time than he could have hoped for.<br /> <br /> Guardian of the Veil (Mage) and Kindly Undertaker (Geist)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-29T16:34:16-08:00","id":1531759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531720#post1531720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Guardian of the Veil (Mage) and Kindly Undertaker (Geist)</div> </div> </div> </div>The old man walked into Molly's and sat down at the first table he saw in front of him, it was a particularly cold night and the bar was packed with people, but there didn't seem to be any particular event, not that he minded, but it's always good to know what people are doing. He exchanges a brief greeting with the bartender and orders a drink with some snacks. The last days weren't easy, the magician's job could be quite thankless at times, he was already used to it, but today he was considering whether he should continue with it, the worst thing was that he couldn't vent to anyone. All the people who he could talk to would call him crazy, at least he could drink, calm down and hopefully carry on for another day.<br /> <br /> Already slightly drunk, the old man is surprised by a woman who sits next to him, she apologizes for disturbing him, the old man waves briefly and goes back to drinking. While waiting for his drink, the girl asks how he feels, the old man responds with: \u201cWhy do you ask?\u201d something the girl responds to with \u201cI\u2019ve met some rookie detectives who just came from a crime scene worthy of a gore horror movie with better face than yours.\u201d The old man takes another sip. &quot;Seriously?&quot; she nods \u201cAre you a detective?\u201d She smiles slightly. \u201cAlmost, coroner.\u201d the old man reacts with a whistle, an old habit from his youth. &quot;And you? What do you work with?\u201d \u201cI work with internal affairs\u201d lies the mage, but not completely, as his real job is to watch over other awakened so that they don't get out of line. &quot;Hard day?&quot; she asks as she sips a martini. \u201cMost are.\u201d He responds by taking another sip. \u201cBut these last few weeks have been special.\u201d The young woman asks what happened. \u201cIt was with a godson (apprentice) of a colleague of mine. He messed up and doesn't even know it and I guess he don't even cares about. The idiot. I promised I would keep an eye on him and now I might have to fire him (from life)\u201d the mage sighs slightly nervously. \u201cDoes your colleague know about this?\u201d asks the girl. \u201cHe's already left (he's missing) I don't even have a way to contact him\u201d he takes another sip to calm down. \u201cSometimes I wonder why I do this.\u201d The girl responds with a simple \u201cI know how it is\u201d the old man would normally think this was nothing more than empty words, but this time, call it intuition if you want, he believes there is something more in store. He passes his hand over the ring on his finger and considers reading the young woman's mind, but soon gives up on that thought, it's not right to use magic on sleepeers for a petty reason like that.<br /> <br /> The girl then begins to tell her story, about when she started as a coroner and how it was interesting at first, but after a few cases her initial enthusiasm gave way to frustration, then depression and later apathy, each case had become just another case, just another problem to be solved, until one day things happened and she was hospitalized, she spent some time between life and death until she recovered. After that, she began to see life in a different way. \u201cWhere are you going with this story?\u201d Asks the old man, already drunk. \u201cNothing really, it\u2019s just that after almost dying I realized how important my work is and you\u2026 need to do what you think is right, otherwise you\u2019ll look back and think you should have done something different.\u201d<br /> <br /> In a very strange way, the old man noticed wisdom in the girl's words, that wouldn't change tomorrow, as he had already decided what he would do, but that conversation made him feel better. He finishes his glass and pays the bartender with some shabby bills, striding out he silently heads off into the night reviewing what he would do tomorrow in his mind. Inside the bar, the woman continues to taste her martini, while a hollow, ghostly voice whispers in her ear: \u201cThank you\u201d.<br /> <br /> Hero (Beast) and Chimeric Deviant","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-01T04:06:27-08:00","id":1531775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531759#post1531759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Hero (Beast) and Chimeric Deviant</div> </div> </div> </div>A women came into the hotel hoping to find the thing that she have been tracking, she go to talk to people at the bar to see if they seen or experience anything scary or weird lately. She talk a couple of people with no result, and then she come across a man cover in bandages, which help obscure most of his feature. The women ask the man about his injuries, the man respond &quot;I fell down a flight stair, thankfully no bones were broken, but I was cover in bruise so the doctor patch me up a bit&quot;, that a lie, those bandage look like they're self apply. The women question the man further, at first the man answer her question, but as she start to ask more and more question that are very invasive, the man start to answer less and less. The women suddenly hear a small growl from the man, it startle her for moment but she stay resolute and start to carefully study the man, she notice that his fingernail are sharp and long his eye have a sort of glow to them and that his smell a little bit like a zoo.<br /> <br /> The man notice this quickly stood up and quickly left the bar, the women quickly follow as she call for back up formulating a plan on how to kill this beastly thing. She block his path, try to guide him toward where is follower are at, but the man is more agile than she thought, he manage evade her attempt at blocking his way, but she was determine to put this thing down. She chase him through the hotel gun drawn, she isn't gonna let this oppoturnity run away from her, she steady the shot and shoot, the bullet hit the man leg slowing him down a bit. The man stumble as the women started to get closer to him, with no option left the man let his inner rage consume him, transforming into a giant beastly creature towering everybody in the general area, the women now realized that this thing isn't what she was after, but she can't this thing live either. The women shoot at the monster, it hit but the monster doesn't seem to care that much, as it jam it claw into her, she manage to grab her knife and stab the monster in the eye which make it let her go, she quickly grab her gun and shoot multiple round into the monster it seem to damage the monster quite a lot. But that victory was short live, as the monster grab and throw her through a window, causing her to pass out, the monster then quickly get away from the scene. The women follower quickly found her, and patch her up.<br /> <br /> Atariya with 10 dots in Atariya Template (Hurt Locker) and Acantus Free Councill Mage (Mage the Awakening)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-02T22:21:22-08:00","id":1531863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531775#post1531775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Atariya with 10 dots in Atariya Template (Hurt Locker) and Acantus Free Councill Mage (Mage the Awakening)</div> </div> </div> </div>The Scarlet Princess is an upscale club where the most upscale sleepers and their guests come to drink, socialize and mostly have some exotic and sometimes morally questionable fun. Among the guests of the night was Marco, a mage from the free council, he wasn't used to this type of place, he preferred less exclusive places and preferably with more respectable people, but the job required him to be at the Scarlet Princess. A few days ago he noticed a peculiar disturbance in the city, he noticed constant changes in the motions of destiny, small variations are relatively common, especially when a supernatural is involved and even more so when a mage using the arcana of Fate is present, unfortunately this was not the case. The changes, although small, were constant and uninterrupted so much so that Marco feared that if this continued the collateral damage could be catastrophic. He traced the source of the anomaly to a guy named Garv, Marco tried to get closer, but whenever he tried was stopped in some way, he himself tried to use his own control over the Fate Arcana, but whenever he made a change it was followed by another that nullified it, finding himself forced to change strategy, the mage decided to find Garv within his own territory, the Scarlet Princess.<br /> <br /> Marco asks the bartender for a drink and while he waited, he discreetly looked for his target. It turned out that I didn't have to look much Garv was in the gaming area, to be more direct in the Russian roulette area, the game is simple, two idiots point a gun at their own head, and it only has one bullet, the one who gets shot loses and usually dies, Garv was confident in his victory, the poor guy who was his opponent was sweating so much that you could fill a bucket with his own sweat, when it was his turn he pointed the gun at his head, but he can't pull the trigger and simply gives up, so two guys in suits carry him to another room as if he were a fainting body. Garv simply walks away with a neutral expression, some of the spectators seemed disappointed with the result and others were clearly disappointed. Marco looks for a way to meet Garv, but is soon surprised by him who invites Marco for a drink, without questioning his own luck, the awakened man accepts. Back at the bar Marco orders a glass of wine, Garv asks the barman to surprise him, so he prepares a cocktail mixing two drinks that Marco was unable to identify, then added some energy drink and finished with only a few of lemon juice, then He places the glass in front of Garv, who tastes it confidently, giving the bartender a thumbs up and also a tip. While drinking, the two talk, Garv does most of the talking, especially about the other members of the club and even giving a subtle indication of where each one was, if it were anyone else Marco would see it as mere arrogance, but in Garv's case it was a Attestation to his influence, he counted at least three dangerous supernaturals in this environment, even if Marco killed him right there, and he doesn't know if he can, he would hardly survive the retaliation and Garv certainly wouldn't die by mundane methods.<br /> <br /> While the wizard was wandering in his thoughts, Garv takes a silver coin out of his pocket, one side of which has a man's face engraved on it and the other has a crown, he throws it into the air where it stops for a few moments and lands in his hand with its man's face side up, Garv looks at the coin for a few seconds and smiles. \u201cYou can go if you want\u201d he says with a smile that showed all his teeth, but still didn't look friendly at all. Marco accepts the offer and slowly leaves the club, when he leaves his chest seems lighter, Garv was certainly a sleeper, but fate favored him in such a way that even the greatest mages envied him. For our awakened guy, all that was left was to believe that destiny knew what it was doing, as him had no answer.<br /> <br /> Makara Nemesis (Beast) Deviant Mutant adapted for underwater exploration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-04T06:32:10-08:00","id":1531953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531863#post1531863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Makara Nemesis (Beast) Deviant Mutant adapted for underwater exploration.</div> </div> </div> </div>A women walk into her favorite bar, with her eye catching blue dress that make her both inncocent looking, while showing off just enough of her skin for people to be looking but doesn't make her innocent look fake. The shallow and beautiful facade hide horror and dept, her every move and her every word is calculate to lure humanity who lurk within the darkness. To night is special, she have a date coming, so she decide to sit in the more private section of the bar where nobody can see her. She wait for her date to arrive, she have been observing him for about a month, but only been his friend for about a week, so she know that he isn't good at time managment. But as minutes turn into hours, she started to worry that she have to find another target, but her worry quickly faded aways as she see her date come through the door, and replace by a new one. Her date is also now part of the family.<br /> <br /> The women head is fill with confusing and contradicting thought, should she spare him because he is now kin, or should he still pay for the crime that he commit before he became kin? But she finally have the answer as the date goes on, he might be kin but he must pay for the crime that he did. You slip him a strong dose of sleeping substance, when he finally fall alseep the women go to the Primodial Dream. There she lure him to step into the deep water with her etheral beauty, at first the man fell for it sinking deeper and deeper into the dept, but the man conviction was strong enough to realized the trap and punch the women in the face. The women then try to make him sink using his guilty secret, it work but the man drag the women with him. The man was stronger than the women expected, while she want to make him learn his lesson, the price doesn't worth the reward. So as soon as she manage to escape the man grasp, she woke him up, causing the man to flip the table and quickly leave.<br /> <br /> Mortal with Animal Possession, Animal Speech, Biokinesis, Biomimicry, Incite Ecosystem, and Invoke Spirit Merit. Cahalith Bone Shadow (Werewolf the Forsaken).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-06T13:42:43-08:00","id":1532107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1531953#post1531953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mortal with Animal Possession, Animal Speech, Biokinesis, Biomimicry, Incite Ecosystem, and Invoke Spirit Merit. Cahalith Bone Shadow (Werewolf the Forsaken).</div> </div> </div> </div>It all started in a clearing inside the national park, Ezekiel was testing his newly discovered abilities, something he has been doing for almost a month, one of his favorites was summoning ghosts, usually because he thought what he summoned looked visually cool.<br /> <br /> He makes a makeshift fire while preparing for another invocation, when he is interrupted by a girl, probably Native American or a descendant of one. She says he should stop what he's doing, but Ezekiel doesn't pay attention, she insists and he responds with an obscene gesture, the next moment he feels a huge hand grab him from behind and throw him against the trees.<br /> <br /> The Native American had grown out of nowhere and gained a lot of muscle, he knew a similar trick and advanced against her, he managed to land a blow, but she quickly immobilized him again and threw him to the ground, without being able to understand anything else Ezekiel makes his invocation , but without thinking much about what it would bring, that's when everything started to go wrong. &quot;What did you do?&quot; asks the girl looking up, the night sky was dominated by an immense apparition with a twisted body like that of an earwig releasing a loud and sharp sound that could only be described as a fly crying. The girl transforms again, gaining even more muscle mass, hair covering her body, claws and fangs appearing, then she lets out a roar that sounds like thunder and that was the last thing he remembers.<br /> <br /> The next morning the forest guard has to close the place and call the authorities. Two bodies were found in a clearing, one of them appears to have been attacked by an animal, another was completely burned and decapitated, in the boy's pocket was his identity, Ezekiel Jones.<br /> <br /> (I would like to take the opportunity to make it clear here that it is not mandatory to respond only to the last suggestion given, you can respond to any comment given by another user and as you can see, it doesn't all have to take place in a bar, I just used it in the name because it was funnier.)<br /> <br /> Insatiable Ravager (Beast) and Destroyer Saboteur Demon that have paranoia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-07T05:00:04-08:00","id":1532154,"title":"","content":"Can we use World of Darkness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-07T07:41:14-08:00","id":1532161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1530940-am-kindred-a-werewolf-and-a-mage-on-the-bar?p=1532154#post1532154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can we use World of Darkness?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want, I just don't know it will work with moderation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}